<node id="[Goan Pomfret Rawa Fry] Step 1">
  <data key="d2">Step 1: Make 3-4 deep slits on bo...</data>
  <data key="d0">Step</data>
  <data key="d1">#F1C40F</data>
  <data key="d3">Make 3-4 deep slits on both sides of the pomfret.</data>
  <data key="d4">1</data>
</node>
<node id="[Goan Pomfret Rawa Fry] Step 2">
  <data key="d2">Step 2: Rub with salt, turmeric a...</data>
  <data key="d0">Step</data>
  <data key="d1">#F1C40F</data>
  <data key="d3">Rub with salt, turmeric and lemon and keep aside for 10-15 minutes.</data>
  <data key="d4">2</data>
</node>
<node id="[Goan Pomfret Rawa Fry] Step 3">
  <data key="d2">Step 3: Dry roast the Kashmiri ch...</data>
  <data key="d0">Step</data>
  <data key="d1">#F1C40F</data>
  <data key="d3">Dry roast the Kashmiri chillies, garlic, ginger, and cumin until aromatic, then blend them with jaggery, turmeric and salt into a smooth, thick paste.</data>
  <data key="d4">3</data>
</node>
<node id="[Goan Pomfret Rawa Fry] Step 4">
  <data key="d2">Step 4: Apply the masala generous...</data>
  <data key="d0">Step</data>
  <data key="d1">#F1C40F</data>
  <data key="d3">Apply the masala generously all over the fish, inside the slits and the cavity. Marinate for at least 1 hour.</data>
  <data key="d4">4</data>
</node>
<node id="[Goan Pomfret Rawa Fry] Step 5">
  <data key="d2">Step 5: Mix rice flour and fine r...</data>
  <data key="d0">Step</data>
  <data key="d1">#F1C40F</data>
  <data key="d3">Mix rice flour and fine rava. Lightly coat the fish on both sides. The coating should be thin, not thick.</data>
  <data key="d4">5</data>
</node>
<node id="[Goan Pomfret Rawa Fry] Step 6">
  <data key="d2">Step 6: Heat coconut oil on a taw...</data>
  <data key="d0">Step</data>
  <data key="d1">#F1C40F</data>
  <data key="d3">Heat coconut oil on a tawa over medium heat. Shallow fry the fish until golden and crisp on both sides. Avoid high heat so the masala caramelizes without burning.</data>
  <data key="d4">6</data>
</node>
